        duration: 'Use at least two nights inside or adjacent to Purnululu for a road visit, following DBCA’s own advice; add a gateway night before entry and another before a flight or long return if the schedule is exposed. The northern and southern ends should be treated as separate days because their internal drive is about 47 km / 80 minutes before any walk. A one-day scenic flight is a different itinerary; confirm whether it is flyover-only and do not describe it as a full park visit. These are planning allowances, not a promise that a campground, road or flight will operate.',
